    # member: whichever server becomes leader is the one that decides, so a half-enabled
    # ensemble answers differently depending on an election. It goes in at provisioning
    # because the alternative is enabling it later on a running consensus layer.
    # See zookeeper_quadlet in cluster_new.py and docs/zookeeper.md.
